	quest.2F2579F78778267D.quest_subtitle: "邪恶的小随从！"
	quest.2F2579F78778267D.title: "找到黑暗森林"
	quest.2FA77B5D5FCA2A4C.quest_subtitle: "如浪潮般平静"
	quest.2FA77B5D5FCA2A4C.title: "月亮"
	quest.3008CACF2AFA43E3.quest_desc: [
		"&#3498DB凯路迪欧&f是一只宏伟且非常有益的&#2ECC71传说宝可梦&f，但他的思绪总是&#E74C3C支配&f着他……"
		""
		"要召唤&#3498DBKeldeo&f，必须先收集它们的&#E67E22Footprints&f来召唤&#3498DBCobalion&f、&#3498DBTerrakion&f和&#3498DBVirizion&f。你将总共获得&#F1C40F3&f个&#FFD700Ingredients&f：&#E67E22Special Meat Chunks&f、&#E67E22Special Spices&f和&#2ECC71Special Leafy Greens&f。将这&#F1C40F3&f个&#FFD700Ingredients&f组合起来，你就能获得&#FFD700Curry of Justice&f。"
		""
		"获得&#FFD700正义咖喱&f后，只需点击，&#3498DB凯路迪欧&f就会&#2ECC71跟随&f你！"
	]
	quest.3008CACF2AFA43E3.quest_subtitle: "Keldeo"
	quest.304BF47DDA6CDA9F.quest_subtitle: "电动小鸟"
	quest.304BF47DDA6CDA9F.title: "捕捉闪电鸟"
	quest.30CAA1E36A906177.quest_desc: ["This is where the &#FF5733Magic&f happens! With our &#3498DBTerminals&f connected, you can browse every single &#2ECC71Item&f in your network from one clean, centralized screen. No more running around between chests!"]
	quest.30CAA1E36A906177.quest_subtitle: "正在打开所有物品"
	quest.30CAA1E36A906177.title: "终端机"
	quest.314503ADAFF2CF7A.quest_subtitle: "我的头好痛"
	quest.314503ADAFF2CF7A.title: "帮帮我，MEW-TWO！"
	quest.329B6FD9F0DCA00A.quest_desc: ["让我们进一步突破&#FFD700极限&f！凭借&#FFD700巨型戒指&f、&#E67E22传奇盟友&f和充分的&#3498DB团队准备&f，我们准备好击败这个&#E74C3C危险仆从&f，向他们展示我们的&#F1C40F真正实力&f！"]
	quest.329B6FD9F0DCA00A.quest_subtitle: "进化60次"
	quest.329B6FD9F0DCA00A.title: "进化宝可梦"
	quest.33732AE959F12A15.quest_desc: [
		"这就是整个&#3498DB存储系统&f的&#FF5733基础&f！用它我们可以连接任何类型的物品栏，例如，只需放置&#2ECC711个方块&f，就能连接一整排&#3498DB箱子&f！"
		""
		"但是，要把它连接到什么呢？你现在就知道了！"
	]
	quest.33732AE959F12A15.quest_subtitle: "基地"
	quest.338A1B03827EFA5B.quest_desc: [
		"要抓住终极大奖，你必须先用&#E74C3CUrns&f召唤出&#3498DBArticuno&f、&#F1C40FZapdos&f和&#FF5733Moltres&f！这样会奖励你三件珍贵的遗物：&#3498DBArctic Stone&f、&#F1C40FZap Stone&f和&#FF5733Molten Stone&f。"
		""
		"将这三种石头在&#2ECC71工作台&f上组合，锻造出终极的&#9b59b6漩涡石&f！"
	]
	quest.338A1B03827EFA5B.quest_subtitle: "在3只鸟之后"
	quest.33940E2E165BB3C8.quest_desc: ["&#FFD700Dynamax&f会大幅改变我们&#3498DBPokémon&f的属性。初始&#E74C3CHP为50%&f，通过喂食我们的&#3498DBPokémon&f&#FFD700Dynamax糖果&f，每颗可增加&#F1C40F5%&f，最高可增至&#2ECC71100%&f！"]
	quest.33940E2E165BB3C8.quest_subtitle: "正在变强中"
	quest.33FAAF8E0A5FA804.quest_desc: [
		"在这个世界，我们正在探索一种名为&#F1C40FZ-招式&f的新技巧。借助它，我们可以在&#3498DB宝可梦&f上装备特定的&#F1C40FZ-道具&f，从而释放出威力&#2ECC71巨大&f的&#3498DB招式&f！"
		""
		"要开始，先制作一个 &#F1C40FZ-Ring&f 并装备上！"
	]
	quest.33FAAF8E0A5FA804.quest_subtitle: "学习如何变得更强大"
	quest.340CED2ADBC8FB78.quest_desc: ["别给他那些乱叫的狗出主意，哈哈哈。"]
	quest.340CED2ADBC8FB78.quest_subtitle: "Zamazenta 会誓死捍卫你"
	quest.340CED2ADBC8FB78.title: "捕捉苍响 Zamazenta"
	quest.347ED80D0A61F8A5.quest_desc: ["制作一个&#F1C40FUrn&f，完成消灭所选&#3498DBType&f中&#E74C3C50 Pokémon&f的&#FF5733Challenge&f！"]
	quest.347ED80D0A61F8A5.quest_subtitle: "Zapdos"
	quest.34B0CE8771FFAF78.quest_desc: ["人越多越热闹，不是吗？孵化10个新蛋怎么样？"]
	quest.34B0CE8771FFAF78.quest_subtitle: "新蛋类物品"
	quest.34B0CE8771FFAF78.title: "孵化10个鸡蛋"
	quest.351F510F369BF715.quest_desc: ["This &#2ECC71Small&f and &#2ECC71Powerful&f &#F1C40FItem&f is &#2ECC71Extremely&f &#2ECC71Good&f; it shows which &#3498DBPokémon&f can hatch and the percentage chance of hatching. Something truly &#2ECC71Incredible&f!"]
	quest.351F510F369BF715.quest_subtitle: "一件独一无二的文物！"
	quest.3527AAAA026141A5.quest_desc: [
		"&#8E44AD达克莱伊&f是一种在这场战斗中从未决定站队的隐藏生物。"
		""
		"去追它吧。为此我们需要 5 个 &#8E44ADNightmare Essences&f，通过在 &#3498DBDream Catcher&f 附近睡觉获得的 &#8E44ADLucid Dreaming&f 效果入睡来获取。"
