	quest.3848E0E21DA4734E.quest_desc: [
		"拥有 &#E67E22岩石&f &#E67E22哥布林&f &#E67E22钥匙&f 后，你就可以解锁 &#E67E22雷吉洛克&f &#E67E22锁&f 了。"
		""
		"Behind the lock will be a &#E74C3CTest&f where each block on the floor is lined with &#F1C40FSand&f blocks and &#E74C3CPressure&f &#E74C3CPlates&f. Right-click the &#F1C40FNote&f &#F1C40FBlock&f next to the entrance and the &#E74C3CRedstone&f &#E74C3CLamps&f on the ceiling will light up a &#2ECC71Safe&f path to walk on."
	]
	quest.3848E0E21DA4734E.quest_subtitle: "在门的后面"
	quest.3848E0E21DA4734E.title: "找到雪点神殿"
	quest.38539F5BD1248C2A.quest_desc: ["现在去抓另外两只&#F1C40F传说宝可梦&f，将&#FFD700Uxie的爪&f、&#FFD700Mesprit的羽毛&f和&#FFD700Azelf的牙&f组合起来，制作出这件珍贵的物品！"]
	quest.38539F5BD1248C2A.quest_subtitle: "下一个传说级物品列表如下："
	quest.389D746ADCDFF017.quest_desc: [
